    "Only the run counts: 150 bpm is 98/138 = 71 % of heart-rate reserve (zone 70-80); 72 bpm (15 %) and 56 (3 %) are under the 25 % floor. TRIMP 45 x 1.275 = 57.4, strain 21 x (1 - e^(-57.4/80)) = 10.8.",
    "The night: the watch's stages (110 + 60 + 90 + 60 + 80 + 40 = 440 min asleep) beat the phone's time in bed. The run's curve is the watch's."
